<p>Hi
  <%= @modder.name %>,</p>

<p>We noticed you haven't signed into your DOL-003.info profile in a while.</p>

<p>In order to keep search results as relevant as possible,
  <strong>we will automatically mark your profile inactive 14 days from today</strong>, unless you log in to DOL-003.info before then. If you are still actively
  modding and want to remain active in the directory, simply sign in within the
  next 2 weeks and this pending action will be canceled. This is also a good
  chance to review the services you have listed and make sure your profile is
  up to date with your current offerings.</p>

<p><%= link_to "Sign in now →", new_user_session_url(subdomain: ""), class: "button" %></p>

<p>Inactive profiles are not shown in search results by default. If you are
  marked inactive, you can sign in at any point after that point and manually
  reactivate your profile. We will never delete your profile without cause or
  your request.</p>

<p>If you have any questions or concerns, please let us know
  <a href="https://discord.gg/HwtPU7tkCT" target="_blank">in Discord</a>.</p>

<p>— The DOL-003.info team</p>
